      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSite for Sale Circa 0.93 Acre / 0.37 Hectare contained in Folio LK42860F\n\nCirca 0.93 acre (0.37 hectare) site ideally located on the main Foynes to Newcastle West road, just 1.5km from Shanagolden village and its range of local amenities, including school, shops, pubs and restaurants.\n\nThe property is also conveniently located within approximately 5km of the N69 coastal road, providing access towards Tarbert and the wider region.\n\nThe site has passed a percolation test, with mains water and electricity available for connection, subject to the relevant requirements and approvals.\n\nPlease note: The site outline shown in the accompanying image is for identification purposes only.\n\nFull details available from the sole selling agent.\n\nPSL No. 001412"
